OL,3,GNEWSASeven ways to repair peat-soil
OL,4,Aroads being tried
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven different types of repair are
OL,7,Fbeing tried on a stretch of carriageway
OL,8,Fin Cambridgeshire to find out which is
OL,9,Fthe best for roads built on peat soil.
OL,11,FThe trial is taking place on the B1099
OL,12,FUpwell Road in March after a #1.5m
OL,13,Fgrant from the Cambridgeshire and
OL,14,FPeterborough Combined Authority (CPCA).
OL,16,FSeven 150-metre (490-ft) sections of
OL,17,Froad have been dug up to test the
OL,18,Fvarious methods.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
